"P0" ""

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - MarchandScottMoralChoiceClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P560695888" "Marchand's Plan"
// DetailString :
"P1149306380" "Marchand recommended that you determine where the Resistance supporting magistrates were hidden so that he could send a PPD team to rescue them from the Devouring Earth attack. This would solidify their support for Emperor Cole by convincing them that the infighting is leaving the Empire vulnerable to attack by the real enemy."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - CalvinScottMoralChoice 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P2043074443" "Empty Clip"
// tDetailString :
"P2545044985" "You picked up this empty pistol clip left behind by Maelstrom during a fight you had with him under the Magisterium. It's a story you like to call: <br><br><color paragon>Collapsing Support</color><br><br>It began when Calvin Scott entrusted you with a plot to blow up the magistrates who were clearly supporters of Emperor Cole. When you went into the tunnels beneath the Magisterium to plant the bombs you encounter Maelstrom. He was sent on a similar mission to plant beacon bombs to draw the Devouring Earth into the vicinity of where the Resistance sympathizing magistrates were being hidden. The two of you got in a fight to settle your differing points of view on the situation, and in the end it was you, not Maelstrom, who decided which side was to suffer collapsing support."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Marchand 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P4119852692" "{HeroName}, the Resistance is on the run. One of our operatives supplied us with intelligence on multiple Resistance cells as well as supporters of the Resistance amongst the magistrates."
// Answer Text :
"P2186660974" "Scott's aware of this."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P369786601" "I had little doubt to that fact, the man seems to know almost everything we do when we do. What is his plan?"
// Answer Text :
"P170032101" "He's wants me to blow up the magistrates loyal to Cole."
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P1029084821" "...<br><br>That man is insane! Is he trying to slit the throat of his own movement? Blowing up the magistrates will condemn the Resistance in the eyes of the people! What's his real game?"
// Answer Text :
"P3994571937" "Removing the Loyalist magistrates will even the playing field."
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P2482912857" "Then keeping the Magistrate Council completely intact is our chief aim. Cole plans on using the Devouring Earth to make an example of the Resistance supporters and to remind the people of Praetoria that our infighting will leave us open to attack. I want you to find the location of those magistrates and get that information to me. I'll send a squad of PPD to ensure that the magistrates get out safely. With any luck we can turn them against the Resistance and keep the entire Magistrate Council in one piece. Calvin Scott's plan to even the playing field will completely backfire."
// Answer Text :
"P3475395790" "I'll find the magistrates."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - ScottDoorDialog 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P619484015" "We've got your bombs ready. Are you ready to go?"
// Answer Text :
"P130774217" "I'm ready to go."
// Answer Text :
"P1927771573" "Give me a minute"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1305693168" "We've got a military edge, {HeroName}, but Crow's betrayal has weakened us politically. Our supporters within the Magistrate Council have been outted. We've gained ground on one front only to lose it on another."
// AcceptString :
"P3621031249" "What's the plan to strike back?"
// SendOffString :
"P2658435087" "Our supporters in the Magistrate Council are no longer of any use to us. I've had them moved into the tunnels for their own safety.<br><br>In response I want you to plant bombs beneath the government building where the remaining Loyalist magisters are currently meeting. If I can't have any support in the council, then neither will Cole."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P517472397" "Blow up the Magistrate Council (Single Player)"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2545916765" "If we delay too long then the Magistrate Council will leave and they'll be harder for us to eliminate. This is our one chance to catch them all together."
// TaskTitle :
"P4070009620" "<color deepskyblue>Collapsing Support</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1744876129" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: Even the Odds</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3090745152" "You've made your way beneath the government building, you'll need to move quickly."

