// SaysList :
"P1772713928" "<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor black>It's... it's the Devouring Earth! Everyone, run!"
// SaysList :
"P1138047256" "<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor black>They're everywhere! You said we'd be safe! A-a-aaagh!"
// SaysList :
"P4206369439" "<t=4 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor black>Get away! Get those monsters away from me!"
// SaysList :
"P434482212" "<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor black>The Magistrates that sided with Cole, they were right!"
// SaysList :
"P1337870646" "<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor black>They're everywhere... there's too many... there's... too.. many...!"

